  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4f57265f2d95884493f924517248368, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldMan 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeText
  paragraphs:
  - Heya hows it going...
  - Sometimes I come down here to feel less blue ya know.
  - 'And to sell bikes, mostly to sell bikes. Bike salesmen. '
  - Pays to bills, gets me going somewhere, gets you going somewhere, ya'know?
  - everybodys gotta go somewhere.
  - Listen, speaking of which, you seem like a good fella.
  - I would say you look like a good fella but I cant see on account of my eyes an
    all.
  - Lost them a while ago, super annoying. Keeps me down.
  - But anyway, smart fella, good fella. Care to buy a bike?
  - Ah, no money. I get it. Really I do, why do you think I'm down here. Nobodies
    buying bikes anymore.
  - Good luck to you. If you ever wanted to sell that hat to someone I'd be willing
    to buy it off ya.
